    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the badly drawn forest full of cute cats!</strong></h2><br>\ud83d\udc08\u200d This game has 3 different levels, in a forest theme. \ud83d\ude3a Try to find 100 kitties in each level! Click on them to color them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795860/extras/684e3f0eb22a6333ee3cd4393a8dc629.poster.avif?t=1707430802\" width=614 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795860/extras/684e3f0eb22a6333ee3cd4393a8dc629.webm?t=1707430802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795860/extras/684e3f0eb22a6333ee3cd4393a8dc629.mp4?t=1707430802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udc31 Look for kitties in the woods.<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude39 Look for kitties in the cabin.<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude3a Look for them in the snow.<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude39 Look for kitties at the lake.<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude40 Look for kitties in the mountains.</li></ul><br>\ud83d\udc31\u200d Look inside, around mountain tops and in the woods, but be careful, some kitties hide too well!<br><br>Key features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\ude39 300 different kitties to find!<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude40 There are hints if there are difficulties!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc31\u200d There is a zoom function to help you see the kitties!</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795860/extras/0e9de75ab479bd5898a8519b55e456ec.avif?t=1707430802\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>\ud83d\udc53 Use your imagination and a sharp eye to spot all the cats in the most unusual situations!<br><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the badly drawn forest full of cute cats!</strong></h2><br>\ud83d\udc08\u200d This game has 3 different levels, in a forest theme. \ud83d\ude3a Try to find 100 kitties in each level! Click on them to color them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795860/extras/684e3f0eb22a6333ee3cd4393a8dc629.poster.avif?t=1707430802\" width=614 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795860/extras/684e3f0eb22a6333ee3cd4393a8dc629.webm?t=1707430802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795860/extras/684e3f0eb22a6333ee3cd4393a8dc629.mp4?t=1707430802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udc31 Look for kitties in the woods.<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude39 Look for kitties in the cabin.<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude3a Look for them in the snow.<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude39 Look for kitties at the lake.<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude40 Look for kitties in the mountains.</li></ul><br>\ud83d\udc31\u200d Look inside, around mountain tops and in the woods, but be careful, some kitties hide too well!<br><br>Key features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\ude39 300 different kitties to find!<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude40 There are hints if there are difficulties!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc31\u200d There is a zoom function to help you see the kitties!</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795860/extras/0e9de75ab479bd5898a8519b55e456ec.avif?t=1707430802\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>\ud83d\udc53 Use your imagination and a sharp eye to spot all the cats in the most unusual situations!<br><br><br>",
